Preamble

This project is an academic research repository focused on forecasting
gold prices (XAU/USD) using LSTM and PSO-based hyperparameter optimization.

This license is intended to preserve openness for study, reproduction,
improvement, and sharing, while ensuring proper attribution to the original
authors and clear disclosure of derivative changes.

